@startuml F1.1-D03-degradacao-graciosa
title F1.1-D03 — Degradação graciosa (solicitações)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "DashboardBFF" as BFF
participant "SolicitacoesQuery" as SolQ
participant "FormativasQuery" as FormQ

Aluno -> WebApp: /inicio
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /bff/dashboard/aluno
Jwt -> BFF: JWT ok

BFF -> SolQ: buscar solicitações
SolQ --> BFF: timeout / 503

BFF -> FormQ: buscar formativas
FormQ --> BFF: OK

note right of BFF
  try/catch por módulo
  HTTP 200 mesmo degradado
  solicitacoes = null
end note

BFF --> WebApp: 200 parcial
WebApp --> Aluno: AlertBanner na seção\ndemais blocos OK

@enduml
